[00:02.991]Rin, who are Rin?
{"凛，你是谁？"}
[00:06.022]It's me, who am I?
{"是我，我是谁？"}
[00:09.026]I am Rin, who are Rin?
{"我是凛，你是谁？"}
[00:12.944]It's fall onto fall onto fall onto fall onto......
{"坠落 坠落 坠落 坠落……"}
[00:16.862]Rin......
{"铃……"}
[00:17.724]I could never find the right way to tell you
{"始终找不到合适的方式告诉你"}
[00:24.307]Have you noticed I've been gone?
{"可曾注意到我已离去？"}
[00:29.323]And it's a long way forward
{"前方路途漫长"}
[00:33.189]So trust in me
{"请相信我"}
[00:36.872]I'll give them shelter like you've done for me
{"我会如你庇护我般庇护他们"}
[00:42.933]And I know,I'm not alone
{"我明白 我并不孤单"}
[00:48.497]You'll watching over us
{"你会守护着我们"}
[00:51.867]Until you're gone
{"直到你离去"}
